}

docs {
**Set the port-out PIN on a number**
Sets the port-out PIN a losing carrier must present to release this number. A PIN is locked for 30 days once set, so this call is idempotent: if the number already has a PIN it is returned unchanged with changed=false; a newly set PIN returns changed=true. Both cases return HTTP 200.

OperationId: `numbersPortOutPinUpdate`
}
